@AppStartup_HostAddress = https://localhost:15100

### Greeting
GET {{AppStartup_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Current UTC time
GET {{AppStartup_HostAddress}}/time
Accept: application/json

### App configuration (name, version, max items)
GET {{AppStartup_HostAddress}}/config
Accept: application/json

### Environment info
GET {{AppStartup_HostAddress}}/environment
Accept: application/json

### List all orders
GET {{AppStartup_HostAddress}}/orders
Accept: application/json

### Get order by id
GET {{AppStartup_HostAddress}}/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Get order by id — not found
GET {{AppStartup_HostAddress}}/orders/999
Accept: application/json

### Add a new order
POST {{AppStartup_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "customerName": "Carol White",
  "total": 249.95,
  "placedAt": "2026-08-28T00:00:00Z"
}
